gh the story, you'll be able to explore your surroundings, and the town of Moonripple. You'll visit different locations and find hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polaroids</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're fun, spicy, sexy renders that you find by exploring the game in free-roam. <br>There's a variety of polaroids and they all have different ways of getting to them.<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery </strong><br>The gallery holds polaroids that you find while exploring the game in free-roam. <br>You can review them here, and check your progress on collecting them all.<strong></strong><br><br>You can also revisit scenes from the game, and see other special content here in the gallery!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go off the beaten path and get achievements, and more hidden polaroids to boot!<strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong> </strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make decisions</strong><br>Decisions affect Anon and Suzie's experiences, and the story.<br>From small immediate results, to larger long lasting consequences!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Painting Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2857910/74ce937143ddfcec50036ef2a67eaf8040b56453.jpg"},{"name":"Moon Howler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2857910/74ce937143ddfcec50036ef2a67eaf8040b56453.jpg"},{"name":"Cheater, cheater!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2857910/74ce937143ddfcec50036ef2a67eaf8040b56453.jpg"},{"name":"Live and let live","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2857910/74ce937143ddfcec50036ef2a67eaf8040b56453.jpg"},{"name":"No pushov